   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"#0563C1\" vlink=\"#954F72\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Helvetica\">Hi everyone,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Helvetica\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Helvetica\">I wanted to send a note about some updates to the tidyLPA package. The next version includes a large number of changes (detailed here: ). It will be version 0.2.0. If you have the chance\r\n to test and provide feedback on it or to ask any questions, they are welcome. You can install the development version (many of you know how to do this\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;\">😊</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Helvetica\">) by running the following lines:<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Helvetica\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Consolas\">install.packages(“devtools”)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Consolas\">devtools::install_github(“jrosen48/tidyLPA”)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Helvetica\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Helvetica\">This version will be submitted to CRAN soon. Just send a note to\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tid...@googlegroups.com</a> with any thoguhts.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Helvetica\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Helvetica\">Sincerely,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Helvetica\">Josh<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Helvetica\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:Times;color:black\">-- <br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt\"><img border=\"0\" width=\"300\" height=\"65\" style=\"width:3.125in;min-height:.677in\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/tidylpa/attach/3da02f9cb788f/image001.gif?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"http://images.utk.edu/images/interface/ut-emailsignature.gif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:#58595b\">Joshua M. Rosenberg, Ph.D.<u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:#58595b\">Assistant Professor, STEM Education<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:#58595b\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:#58595b\">Dept. of Theory and Practice in Teacher Education<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:#58595b\">The University of Tennessee, Knoxville<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:#58595b\">420 Claxton, 1122 Volunteer Boulevard, Knoxville, TN 37996<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:#58595b\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:#58595b\"><a href=\"tel:(865)%20974-5973\" value=\"+18659745973\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(865) 974-5973</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:#58595b\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">jmros...@utk.edu</span></a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:#58595b\">&lt;<a href=\"http://jmichaelrosenberg.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://jmichaelrosenberg.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496159656000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3NvLM_bmX_qe-AoaVAJQvY\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">homepage</span></a>&gt;</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
